      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{% comment %} artpixe-seo-bloc-one-piece.liquid — Bloc SEO i18n + maillage interne {% endcomment %}\n\n{% assign lang = localization.language.iso_code | default: request.locale.iso_code | default: shop.locale %}\n\n<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap');\n\n.apx-seo{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 20px 24px;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;}\n.apx-seo-divider{height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);margin-bottom:28px;}\n.apx-seo-h2{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(20px,3.5vw,28px);letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1.1;color:#f0ede8;margin-bottom:16px;}\n.apx-seo-h2 em{color:#f5a623;font-style:normal;}\n.apx-seo-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:16px;}\n@media(max-width:560px){.apx-seo-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}\n.apx-seo-card{background:#141416;padding:16px 18px;}\n.apx-seo-card-title{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f5a623;margin-bottom:7px;}\n.apx-seo-card p{font-size:13px;color:#9a9690;line-height:1.65;margin:0;}\n.apx-seo-card p strong{color:#f0ede8;font-weight:500;}\n.apx-seo-outro{font-size:13px;color:#9a9690;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16px;}\n.apx-seo-outro strong{color:#f0ede8;font-weight:500;}\n.apx-seo-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:16px;}\n.apx-seo-tag{font-size:11px;color:#5a5855;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);border-radius:99px;padding:2px 10px;}\n.apx-seo-link{color:#f5a623;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(245,166,35,.25);transition:border-color .15s;}\n.apx-seo-link:hover{border-bottom-color:#f5a623;}\n.apx-seo-maillage{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);}\n.apx-seo-maillage-link{font-size:12px;color:#9a9690;background:#141416;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-radius:99px;padding:5px 14px;text-decoration:none;transition:all .15s;white-space:nowrap;}\n.apx-seo-maillage-link:hover{color:#f5a623;border-color:rgba(245,166,35,.3);}\n.apx-seo-maillage-label{font-size:11px;color:#5a5855;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;width:100%;margin-bottom:2px;}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"apx-seo\">\n  <div class=\"apx-seo-divider\"></div>\n\n  {% if lang == 'fr' %}\n    <h2 class=\"apx-seo-h2\"><em>Affiche Wanted One Piece</em> personnalisée — tout savoir avant de commander</h2>\n  {% elsif lang == 'en' %}\n    <h2 class=\"apx-seo-h2\">Personalized <em>Wanted One Piece Poster</em> — everything to know before ordering</h2>\n  {% elsif lang == 'es' %}\n    <h2 class=\"apx-seo-h2\"><em>Póster Wanted One Piece</em> personalizado — todo lo que debes saber antes de pedir</h2>\n  {% elsif lang == 'de' %}\n    <h2 class=\"apx-seo-h2\">Personalisiertes <em>Wanted One Piece Poster</em> — alles vor der Bestellung wissen</h2>\n  {% elsif lang == 'it' %}\n    <h2 class=\"apx-seo-h2\"><em>Poster Wanted One Piece</em> personalizzato — tutto da sapere prima di ordinare</h2>\n  {% else %}\n    <h2 class=\"apx-seo-h2\"><em>Affiche Wanted One Piece</em> personnalisée — tout savoir avant de commander</h2>\n  {% endif %}\n\n  <div class=\"apx-seo-grid\">\n\n    {% comment %} CARTE 1 — Cadeau {% endcomment %}\n    <div class=\"apx-seo-card\">\n      {% if lang == 'fr' %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">🎁 Cadeau fan One Piece</div>\n        <p>Anniversaire, Noël, fête des pères — ce <strong>cadeau One Piece personnalisé</strong> fonctionne pour toutes les occasions. Le format <strong>Cadre Displate métal</strong> est le plus offert. Pour un <strong>cadeau anniversaire One Piece</strong>, commande au moins 5 jours ouvrés à l'avance. Découvre aussi notre <a href=\"/pages/cadeau-manga-personnalise\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">guide cadeaux manga</a>.</p>\n      {% elsif lang == 'en' %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">🎁 Gift for One Piece fans</div>\n        <p>Birthday, Christmas, Father's Day — this <strong>personalized One Piece gift</strong> works for any occasion. The Metal Displate Frame is our most gifted format. For a <strong>One Piece birthday gift</strong>, order at least 5 business days in advance. Browse our <a href=\"/collections/portrait-personnalise-manga\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">manga portrait collection</a>.</p>\n      {% elsif lang == 'es' %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">🎁 Regalo fan de One Piece</div>\n        <p>Cumpleaños, Navidad, Día del Padre — este <strong>regalo personalizado de One Piece</strong> funciona para cualquier ocasión. El Marco Displate metálico es el más regalado. Para un <strong>regalo de cumpleaños fan de One Piece</strong>, haz tu pedido con 5 días hábiles de antelación. Descubre nuestra <a href=\"/collections/portrait-personnalise-manga\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">colección de retratos manga</a>.</p>\n      {% elsif lang == 'de' %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">🎁 Geschenk für One Piece Fans</div>\n        <p>Geburtstag, Weihnachten, Vatertag — dieses <strong>personalisierte One Piece Geschenk</strong> passt zu jedem Anlass. Der Displate Metallrahmen ist unser meistgekauftes Format. Für ein <strong>One Piece Geburtstagsgeschenk</strong> mindestens 5 Werktage im Voraus bestellen. Entdecke unsere <a href=\"/collections/portrait-personnalise-manga\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">Manga-Portrait-Kollektion</a>.</p>\n      {% elsif lang == 'it' %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">🎁 Regalo per fan di One Piece</div>\n        <p>Compleanno, Natale, Festa del papà — questo <strong>regalo personalizzato di One Piece</strong> funziona per ogni occasione. La Cornice Displate in metallo è il formato più regalato. Per un <strong>regalo di compleanno fan di One Piece</strong>, ordina almeno 5 giorni lavorativi prima. Scopri la nostra <a href=\"/collections/portrait-personnalise-manga\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">collezione ritratti manga</a>.</p>\n      {% else %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">🎁 Cadeau fan One Piece</div>\n        <p>Anniversaire, Noël, fête des pères — ce <strong>cadeau One Piece personnalisé</strong> fonctionne pour toutes les occasions. <a href=\"/pages/cadeau-manga-personnalise\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">Guide cadeaux manga →</a></p>\n      {% endif %}\n    </div>\n\n    {% comment %} CARTE 2 — Aperçu {% endcomment %}\n    <div class=\"apx-seo-card\">\n      {% if lang == 'fr' %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">🕐 Aperçu portrait en 24–48 h ouvrées</div>\n        <p>L'<strong>aperçu de ton portrait One Piece</strong> est envoyé sous 24–48 h ouvrées. Tu valides — ou tu demandes des <strong>retouches illimitées</strong> sans frais. Consulte <a href=\"/pages/comment-ca-marche\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">comment ça marche</a> pour voir toutes les étapes en détail.</p>\n      {% elsif lang == 'en' %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">🕐 Portrait preview in 48–72h</div>\n        <p>Your <strong>One Piece portrait preview</strong> is sent within 48–72 business hours. You approve — or request <strong>unlimited revisions</strong> at no extra cost. See <a href=\"/pages/comment-ca-marche\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">how it works</a> for full details.</p>\n      {% elsif lang == 'es' %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">🕐 Vista previa del retrato en 48–72h</div>\n        <p>Tu <strong>vista previa del retrato de One Piece</strong> se envía en 48–72 horas hábiles. Lo apruebas — o solicitas <strong>retoques ilimitados</strong> sin coste adicional. Consulta <a href=\"/pages/comment-ca-marche\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">cómo funciona</a> para ver todos los pasos.</p>\n      {% elsif lang == 'de' %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">🕐 Portrait-Vorschau in 48–72h</div>\n        <p>Deine <strong>One Piece Portrait-Vorschau</strong> wird innerhalb von 48–72 Werktunden gesendet. Du genehmigst — oder verlang