estilo de One Piece elegir?</div>\n        <p>Nuestro diseñador digital domina todos los arcos: <strong>Wano, Marineford, New World</strong>. Indica nombre pirata, recompensa en berries, colores. Consulta nuestra <a href=\"/pages/creer-affiche-wanted-one-piece\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">guía del póster Wanted One Piece</a> para elegir.</p>\n      {% elsif lang == 'de' %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">🏴‍☠️ Welchen One Piece Stil wählen?</div>\n        <p>Unser digitaler Grafiker beherrscht alle Bögen: <strong>Wano, Marineford, New World</strong>. Gib Piratenname, Kopfgeld und Farben an. Lies unseren <a href=\"/pages/creer-affiche-wanted-one-piece\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">Wanted One Piece Poster Guide</a> zur Hilfe.</p>\n      {% elsif lang == 'it' %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">🏴‍☠️ Quale stile One Piece scegliere?</div>\n        <p>Il nostro grafico digitale padroneggia tutti gli archi: <strong>Wano, Marineford, New World</strong>. Indica il nome del pirata, la taglia in berry, i colori. Consulta la nostra <a href=\"/pages/creer-affiche-wanted-one-piece\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">guida poster Wanted One Piece</a> per scegliere.</p>\n      {% else %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">🏴‍☠️ Quel style One Piece choisir ?</div>\n        <p>Notre graphiste maîtrise tous les arcs : <strong>Wano, Marineford, New World</strong>. <a href=\"/pages/creer-affiche-wanted-one-piece\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">Guide affiche Wanted →</a></p>\n      {% endif %}\n    </div>\n\n    {% comment %} CARTE 4 — Groupe {% endcomment %}\n    <div class=\"apx-seo-card\">\n      {% if lang == 'fr' %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">👥 Solo, couple ou famille</div>\n        <p>Tu veux un <strong>portrait One Piece pour couple</strong> ou toute ta famille sur la même affiche ? Précise le nombre de personnages dans tes instructions. Explore aussi tous nos <a href=\"/collections/portrait-personnalise-manga\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">portraits manga personnalisés</a>.</p>\n      {% elsif lang == 'en' %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">👥 Solo, couple or family</div>\n        <p>Want a <strong>One Piece couple portrait</strong> or your whole family on the same poster? Specify the number of characters in your instructions. Explore all our <a href=\"/collections/portrait-personnalise-manga\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">personalized manga portraits</a>.</p>\n      {% elsif lang == 'es' %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">👥 Solo, pareja o familia</div>\n        <p>¿Quieres un <strong>retrato de One Piece en pareja</strong> o toda tu familia? Indica el número de personajes en tus instrucciones. Explora todos nuestros <a href=\"/collections/portrait-personnalise-manga\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">retratos manga personalizados</a>.</p>\n      {% elsif lang == 'de' %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">👥 Solo, Paar oder Familie</div>\n        <p>Möchtest du ein <strong>One Piece Pärchen-Portrait</strong> oder deine ganze Familie? Gib die Anzahl der Charaktere an. Entdecke alle unsere <a href=\"/collections/portrait-personnalise-manga\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">personalisierten Manga-Portraits</a>.</p>\n      {% elsif lang == 'it' %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">👥 Solo, coppia o famiglia</div>\n        <p>Vuoi un <strong>ritratto One Piece per coppia</strong> o tutta la tua famiglia? Specifica il numero di personaggi. Esplora tutti i nostri <a href=\"/collections/portrait-personnalise-manga\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">ritratti manga personalizzati</a>.</p>\n      {% else %}\n        <div class=\"apx-seo-card-title\">👥 Solo, couple ou famille</div>\n        <p>Tu veux un <strong>portrait One Piece pour couple</strong> ? <a href=\"/collections/portrait-personnalise-manga\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">Voir toute la collection →</a></p>\n      {% endif %}\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  {% comment %} OUTRO {% endcomment %}\n  {% if lang == 'fr' %}\n    <p class=\"apx-seo-outro\"><strong>350 avis 5★ Loox · 4,4/5 Trust