-link\">retrato Demon Slayer</a>.</p>\n  {% elsif lang == 'de' %}\n    <p class=\"apx-seo-outro\"><strong>350 5★ Loox Bewertungen · 4,4/5 Trustpilot · 2.532 erstellte Portraits.</strong> Jedes <strong>personalisierte Wanted One Piece Poster</strong> von unserem digitalen Grafiker, mit <strong>unbegrenzten Korrekturen</strong> und <strong>48h-Vorschau</strong>. Weitere Portraits: <a href=\"/products/portrait-personnalise-naruto\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">Naruto Portrait</a>, <a href=\"/products/portrait-personnalise-dragon-ball-z\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">Dragon Ball Z Portrait</a>, <a href=\"/products/portrait-manga-personnalise-demon-slayer\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">Demon Slayer Portrait</a>.</p>\n  {% elsif lang == 'it' %}\n    <p class=\"apx-seo-outro\"><strong>350 recensioni 5★ Loox · 4,4/5 Trustpilot · 2.532 ritratti creati.</strong> Ogni <strong>poster Wanted One Piece personalizzato</strong> realizzato dal nostro grafico digitale, con <strong>ritocchi illimitati</strong> e <strong>anteprima in 48h</strong>. Altri ritratti: <a href=\"/products/portrait-personnalise-naruto\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">ritratto Naruto</a>, <a href=\"/products/portrait-personnalise-dragon-ball-z\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">ritratto Dragon Ball Z</a>, <a href=\"/products/portrait-manga-personnalise-demon-slayer\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">ritratto Demon Slayer</a>.</p>\n  {% else %}\n    <p class=\"apx-seo-outro\"><strong>350 avis 5★ Loox · 4,4/5 Trustpilot · 2 532 portraits créés.</strong> Chaque <strong>affiche Wanted One Piece personnalisée</strong> réalisée par notre graphiste numérique. Autres portraits : <a href=\"/products/portrait-personnalise-naruto\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">Naruto</a>, <a href=\"/products/portrait-personnalise-dragon-ball-z\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">Dragon Ball Z</a>, <a href=\"/products/portrait-manga-personnalise-demon-slayer\" class=\"apx-seo-link\">Demon Slayer</a>.</p>\n  {% endif %}\n\n  {% comment %} TAGS SEO invisibles {% endcomment %}\n  <div class=\"apx-seo-ta